<title>SPAIN: Asturiana H1 pre-tax profit 4.01 bln pesetas.</title>
<headline>Asturiana H1 pre-tax profit 4.01 bln pesetas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for Spanish zinc producer Asturiana del Zinc for the first half of 1997 (in billions of pesetas, unless stated):</p>
<p> Pretax profit			  4.01	vs     0.74 loss</p>
<p> Net taxed				2.93	vs     0.75 loss</p>
<p> Attributable profit		  2.93	vs     0.75 loss</p>
<p> Net turnover			  36.75	vs    26.38</p>
<p> Net operating profit		 6.83	vs     2.24</p>
<p> Ordinary profit			4.59	vs     1.50</p>
<p> Total value of production	 39.91	vs    27.42</p>
<p> Net purchases			 19.08	vs    14.28</p>
<p> Operating/external costs	   6.43	vs     5.15</p>
<p> Personnel costs			4.31	vs     4.62</p>
<p> Financial income		     0.99	vs     0.80</p>
<p> Financial costs			3.23	vs     1.51</p>
<p> Goodwill depreciation		n.a.	vs     0.03</p>
<p> Corporate tax			  1.09	vs     0.01</p>
<p> Total assets			  65.96	vs    63.18</p>
</text>
